</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MarketingDesigner -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MarketingDesigner">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Market Sales Party Roles ABE"/>
<rdf:label>MarketingDesigner</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The marketing campaign Designer is responsible for the set-up of the campaign. He generates the target list and produces the campaign follow-up reports. He is in charge to monitor the campaign management performance in real time as the campaign is being executed and to propose corrective actions if necessary.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

