<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MarketStrategy -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MarketStrategy">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Market and Sales Strategy Plan ABE"/>
<rdf:label>MarketStrategy</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A carefully devised plan of action on how to address the market with appropriate ProductOfferings and SalesChannesl.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#OperationalMarketingPlan -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#OperationalMarketingPlan">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Market and Sales Strategy Plan ABE"/>
<rdf:label>OperationalMarketingPlan</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>An OperationalMarketingPlan defines the long-term or middle-term Marketing strategy for product placement.

The OperationalMarketingPlan is an abstract class that defines the hierarchical view of a package of OperationalMarketingPlan item.

It may be: A Composite OperationalMktPlan corresponding to several OperationalMktPlan items that are associated together within in the same marketing program. An Atomic OperationalMktPlan corresponding to a campaign plan which is the smallest level of the OperationalMarketingPlan hierarchy.

Marketing Plan is a Composite OperationalMktPlan composed of Marketing Programs

Marketing Program is a Composite OperationalMktPlan composed of Campaign Plans

A Marketing Campaign is associated to a Campaign Plan that is an AtomicOperationalMktPlan.

An OperationalMarketingPlan specifies the Budget allocated, forcasted and achieved,

         the targeted Parties (PartyProfile and PartyProfileType),

         the SaleChannel to be used,

         the ProductSpecification, ProductSpecificationType, CommercialClassification and ProductOffering it gives away or aims to place,

         the MarketingCampaignRoles involved,

         and the MarketingObjectives that must be achieved including the indicators used to evaluate the achievement (MktIndicatorSpec)</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_ID -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_ID">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#OperationalMarketingPlan"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_name -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_name">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#OperationalMarketingPlan"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_type -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_type">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#OperationalMarketingPlan"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

