<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MarketingIndicatorDefinition -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MarketingIndicatorDefinition">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Marketing Performance ABE"/>
<rdf:label>MarketingIndicatorDefinition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MarketingIndicatorDefinition specifies a metric measure. It specifies measure (how to calculate it) with targeted values and associated actions when the thresholds arent achieved. 

The MarketingIndicatorDefinitions are used to define objectives of OperationalMarketingPlans and MarketingCampaigns such as performance or budget objectives.

MarketingIndicatorDefinition is a type of MetricDefMeasure.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

