<rdfs:comment>A detailed description of AppliedCustomerBillingRate entity. This business entity holds the definition of all the characteristics (variant attributes) of AppliedCustomerBillingRate, as well and type attributes such as description (derived from RootEntity) and revenueType.</rdfs:comment>
