<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Billing Account ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Billing Account ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>Used to manage account and its balance information. Balance (or balances) represents an amount, usually with some monetary value, usually an aggregation, that indicates an aspect of liability (often financial) between the service provider and the account holder (usually a customer). This amount can be monetary amount, or non-monetary (such as free minutes, or amount of loyalty points), can represent credit that the CSP holds for the customer (for example pre-paid balance) or debt that the customer owes the CSP (as is the normal case for post-paid A/R balance). 

Related tightly with customer payment and other ABEs especially in charing domain. It is intended to support a converged model applicable for both prepaid and postpaid cases.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Customer Billing Account ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Customer Billing Account ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Customer Billing Account ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Billing Account ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Business_Entity.Customer Domain"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1# hasBE_for_Customer Billing Account ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasBE_for_Customer Billing Account ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasBE"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Billing Account ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BalanceUsageRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ChargeAmountThreshold"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ChargeSplittingRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#CustomerBillingAccount"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#CustomerBillingAccountAssignment"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#CustomerBillingAccountBalance"/>
<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Customer Billing Account ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Customer Billing Account ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BalanceUsageRule -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BalanceUsageRule">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Billing Account ABE"/>
<rdf:label>BalanceUsageRule</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Balance-level rule information constraining the application of BillingAccountBalance. It could describe the sharing rule, by which BillingAccountBalance could be shared between different kinds of FinancialCharge which is related to different customers product charge. It could emphasize associated BillingAccountBalance is only applicable for certain usage, for example only applicable for local phone call or domestic flow or intra-PLMN SMS.  BalanceUsageRule also includes priority and other kinds of rules limits the application of BillingAccountBalance.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_description -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_description">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BalanceUsageRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_ID -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_ID">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BalanceUsageRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_validFor -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_validFor">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BalanceUsageRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ChargeAmountThreshold -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ChargeAmountThreshold">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Billing Account ABE"/>
<rdf:label>ChargeAmountThreshold</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>ChargeAmountThreshold constrains relationship between product charges and BillingAccount(s) by specifying a limited amount beyond which product charges will not be affordable by associated BillingAccount.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_amountLimited -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_amountLimited">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ChargeAmountThreshold"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ChargeSplittingRule -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ChargeSplittingRule">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Billing Account ABE"/>
<rdf:label>ChargeSplittingRule</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>ChargeSplittingRule is charge-level/account-level rule information describing which product charge should be directed to which BillingAccounts. It can base on time and/or percentage.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#CustomerBillingAccount -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#CustomerBillingAccount">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Billing Account ABE"/>
<rdf:label>CustomerBillingAccount</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A CustomerBillingAccount is an arrangement that a Customer has with an enterprise (such as a communication service provider) through which the enterprise collects AppliedPartyBillingRate (i.e. charges) to structure bills. It also collects payments for Products that are supplied by the enterprise to the Customer. The AppliedPartyBillingRates are invoiced to the BillingAccount via CustomerBills.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_creditLimit -->

