<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Bill Collection ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Customer Payment ABE represents the transfer of wealth from a customer for a product or usage of product.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Customer Payment ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

