<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>Product Party Roles ABE contains all PartyRoles related to the Product Domain such as ProductManager.

Roles related to Customer such as Payer are located in Customer Domain</rdfs:comment>
