<rdf:label>ProductTestSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The product test specification describes the product test in terms of parameters to be configured and measures to be taken.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Product Configuration ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Product Configuration ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The definition of how a Product operates or functions in terms of CharacteristicSpecification(s) and related ResourceSpec(s), ProductSpec(s), ServiceSpec(s) as well as a representation of how a Product operates or functions in terms of characteristics and related Resource(s), Product(s), Service(s).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Product Configuration ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Product Configuration ABE -->

