<rdf:label>ProductConfigSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The definition of how a Product operates or functions in terms of CharacteristicSpecification(s) and related ResourceSpec(s), ProductSpec(s), ServiceSpec(s).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

