<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Loyalty ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Loyalty Program Specification ABE contains all entities specifying a loyalty program such as LoyaltyProgramProdSpec and LoyaltyRule.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Loyalty Program Specification ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

