<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Loyalty Program Specification ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Loyalty Program Specification ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#LoyaltyAction -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#LoyaltyAction">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Loyalty Program Specification ABE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyAction</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyAction may correspond either to a CustomerProductOrder (Ex: 100 SMS free), or to an Interaction (Ex: a SMS notifying the 100 SMS free) or to a LoyaltyEarn (Ex: 100 points on the LoyaltyAccount)</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#LoyaltyCondition -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#LoyaltyCondition">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Loyalty Program Specification ABE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyCondition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyCondition specifies the condition that has to be evaluated to decide if the LoyaltyAction(s) from the LoyaltyRule have to be done.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#LoyaltyEvent -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#LoyaltyEvent">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Loyalty Program Specification ABE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyEvent</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The different types of LoyaltyEvent may be event that occurs on BillingAccount (Ex: amount of Invoice, recurring charge), on PartyRole (Ex: CustomerProductOrder amount), on Products (Ex: monthly international usage volume).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#LoyaltyProgramProdSpec -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#LoyaltyProgramProdSpec">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Loyalty Program Specification ABE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyProgramProdSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyProgramProdSpec is a type of AtomicProductSpecification, is packaged through ProductOffering and is instantiated in the same manner in the installed base (LoyaltyProgramProduct that is a type of ProductComponent).

A LoyaltyProgramProdSpec defines one or more LoyaltyRules that have to be checked in order to identify the actions to apply.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

