<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Strategic Product Portfolio Plan ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Strategic Product Portfolio Plan ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ProductOfferingStrategy -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ProductOfferingStrategy">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Strategic Product Portfolio Plan ABE"/>
<rdf:label>ProductOfferingStrategy</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A strategy employed to promote a ProductOffering.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Product ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Product ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>Represents an instance in the product inventory of a product offering or specification subscribed or not yet subscribed to by a Customer to the CSP or by the CSP to a BusinessParnter, the place where the product is in use, as well as configuration characteristics, such as assigned telephone numbers and internet addresses.  The Product ABE also tracks the links to services and/or resources through which the product is realized.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Product ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Product ABE -->

