<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ProductCharacteristicValue"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ProductComponent"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ProductPlaceRole"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ProductRelationship"/>
<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Product ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Product ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Product -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Product">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Product ABE"/>
<rdf:label>Product</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A ProductOffering obtained by a Customer, or other interested Party playing a PartyRole, appearing as a CustomerProductOrderItem or a BusinessPartnerOrderItem, which could take the form of an Agreement. ProductSpecificationCharacteristic(s) in part define the Product. A Product is realized as one or more Service(s) and/or Resource(s).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_status -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_status">
