<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Product Order ABE"/>
<rdf:label>ProductOrder</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A ProductOrder represents a communication used to procure, update or remove one or many Products in the context of a ProductOffering through all its ProductOrderItems.

One or many PartyRoles might be involved in a ProductOrder / ProductOrderItem such as Distributor, Holder, Buyer or DeliveryDriver.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

