<rdf:label>ServiceDesigner</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A ServiceDesigner is a party role which is responsible for the design of the Service Provider know-how (CustomerFacingServiceSpecs). To be valid a know-how needs to align with one or more technical solutions (ResourceFacingServiceSpec or Suppliers ProductSpec).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

