<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Facing Service Spec ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Facing Service Spec ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Service Specification ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Customer Facing Service Spec ABE defines the common characteristics for a set of CustomerFacingServices. This scales by enabling multiple CustomerFacingServiceSpecs to be defined to model the common characteristics of different groups of CustomerFacingServices.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Customer Facing Service Spec ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

