<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Facing Service Spec Role ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Customer Facing Service Spec Role ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Service Specification ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Customer Facing Service Spec Role ABE defines a ServiceSpecification, in terms of a set of ServiceSpecificationRoles, for a CustomerFacingService. It is used to represent the shared characteristics of a CustomerFacingService. This enables the CustomerFacingService to be managed abstractly using ServiceSpecificationRoles. It also helps define a CustomerFacingServiceSpecification in terms of the functions that it has or provides.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Customer Facing Service Spec Role ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Customer Facing Service Spec Role ABE -->

