<rdfs:comment>This is an abstract base class that defines a stand-alone CustomerFacingService that meets the needs of a Product. Stand-alone CustomerFacingServices may be linked directly to a Product or aggregated by a CustomerFacingServiceProduct.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

