<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ResourceFacingServiceComposite -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ResourceFacingServiceComposite">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Resource Facing Service ABE"/>
<rdf:label>ResourceFacingServiceComposite</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This is an abstract base class that defines an integrated set of ResourceFacingServices that collectively meets the needs of a CustomerFacingService. For example, the Customer may have requested "GoldService", which is a ServicePackage that defines a set of ServiceBundles, each of which has its own QoS. A set of ResourceFacingServices can then be defined, one for each different ServiceBundle instance, that provides the required QoS for each ServiceBundle instance.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

