<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Service Test ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Service Test ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>A Service Test is a function performed on a service that results in measures being produced that reflect the functioning of the entity under test.</rdfs:comment>
