<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Service Test ABE"/>
<rdf:label>ServiceTestSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The service test specification describes the service test in terms of parameters to be configured and measures to be taken.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Service Performance ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Service Performance ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Service Performance ABE collects, correlates, consolidates, and validates various performance statistics and other operational characteristics of customer and resource facing service entities. It provides a set of entities that can monitor and report on performance. Each of these entities also conducts network performance assessment against planned goals, performs various aspects of trend analysis, including error rate and cause analysis and Service degradation.
Entities in this ABE also manage the traffic generated by a Service, as well as traffic trend analysis. This is important for newer technologies that separate data, control and management functions for a given Service.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Service Performance ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Service Performance ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Service Performance ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Service Performance ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Business_Entity.Service Domain"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1# hasBE_for_Service Performance ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasBE_for_Service Performance ABE">
