<rdf:label>ResourceSpecVersionDetails</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This class defines the semantics of the modifiesResourceSpec aggregation. Specifically, it enables an application to define which set of versions of this ResourceSpecification are appropriate for a given task.This aggregation represents the set of versions of this ResourceSpecification. The semantics of this aggregation are implemented with the ResourceSpecVersionDetails class.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

