<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Address ABE"/>
<rdf:label>NetworkAddress</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This class represents the generic concept of a network address. Its subclasses define different types of addresses of different technologies, such as an IPAddress vs. an IPXAddress. Its utility lies in its ability to serve as a convenient point for sourcing and terminating relationships. This eliminates undue duplication of relationships that interact with the subclasses of NetworkAddress.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

