<rdf:label>TrafficMappingTableRow</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The TrafficMappingTableRow provides a specific rule for one manipulation, of a set of manipulations, of one or more components flows within the flow dealt with by the instance of LayerTermination.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

