<rdf:label>SRTBridging</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Source-route transparent (SRT) bridges are a hybrid of translational bridges and source-route bridges, as they are able to forward traffic from both transparent and source-route end nodes.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

