<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Hardware ABE"/>
<rdf:label>PhysicalContainer</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This is an abstract class that is used to add additional semantics to the ManagedHardware class. Its attributes define whether a ManagedHardware object can be removed and/or replaced, and whether this action requires power to be removed or not when the action is performed.</rdfs:comment>
