<rdf:label>BusinessPartnerProductOrder</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A BusinessPartnerProductOrder specifies a communication used to procure, update or remove one or many Products in the context of a ProductOffering for the Service Provider.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

