<rdf:label>BusinessPartnerPaymentItem</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>BusinessPartnerPaymentItem is the application of BusinessPartnerPayment. BusinessPartnerPaymentItem is applied to PartyBill or AppliedPartyBillingRate.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

