<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Party Bill Collection ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>To be checked if a CSP follows Dunning cases from Suppliers</rdfs:comment>
