<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Party Revenue Share ABE"/>
<rdf:label>RevenueShareProdOfferRelationship</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A relationship between two PartyRevenueShareProdOffers. For example, after shares are reconciled a new PartyRevenueShareProdOffer may be determined that replaces the original share that was determined.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_type -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_type">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#RevenueShareProdOfferRelationship"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_validFor -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_validFor">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#RevenueShareProdOfferRelationship"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Party Revenue and Settlement ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Party Revenue Sharing Reconciliation ABE ensures that two sets of party revenue sharing records are aligned and agreed upon. For example, an enterprise may receive an invoice from another party that is compared to the revenue share that has been determined to be shared with the party contained in the Party Revenue Share ABE.
Reconciliation includes comparing what is received with what is to be paid, invoiced or credited/debited to an bill/invoice or account balance, identifying and resolving discrepancies, identifying adjustments to revenue to be shared, and tracking discrepancy resolution.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Business_Entity.Business Partner Domain"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1# hasBE_for_Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasBE_for_Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasBE"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyRevenueShareReconciliation"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyRevShareReconciliationItem"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyRevShareReconDiscrepancy"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#RevShareReconDiscrepNotification"/>
<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyRevenueShareReconciliation -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyRevenueShareReconciliation">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Party Revenue Share Reconciliation ABE"/>
<rdf:label>PartyRevenueShareReconciliation</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A comparison of  two sets of party revenue sharing records are aligned and agreed upon. A comparison identifies and resolves discrepancies and identifies revenue share adjustments. This is done by comparing the revenue determined by an enterprise that is to be shared with another party with the information provided by the party.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_description -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_description">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyRevenueShareReconciliation"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_ID -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_ID">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyRevenueShareReconciliation"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_reconciliationDate -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_reconciliationDate">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyRevenueShareReconciliation"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_reconciliationDateComplete -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_reconciliationDateComplete">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyRevenueShareReconciliation"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_status -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_status">
