<rdf:label>PartyRevenueSharingModel</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The definition of how revenue is shared by an enterprise with one or more other parties. Revenue sharing models are a key component revenue sharing agreements.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

