<rdf:label>AppliedPartyPenaltyCharge</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The AppliedPartyPenaltyCharge is a type of AppliedPartyBillingCharge.
It represents penalty charges such as late fees, payment rejection fees, interests, that could be applied, linked to dunning of a due amount, in order to bill the party according to contractual terms and conditions.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

