<rdfs:comment>The Employee Pay ABE provides the details of the Employee Pay and related components , Pay Group, Pay Range and Pay Grade which is the core structure for any organisations Pay Structure defined in the HCM system. Below diagram is the detailed view of the entities and their relationships.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Employee Pay ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

