<rdf:label>EmployeePay</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>EmployeePay describes pay information for an Employee such as salary, bonus or any other monetary benefits.

This is useful reading all changes over a period of time. This is further defined with the frequency amount pay group. </rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

