<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Security Vulnerability Scoring Definition ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#AtomicSecVulScoringMetricDefn -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#AtomicSecVulScoringMetricDefn">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Security Vulnerability Scoring Definition ABE"/>
<rdf:label>AtomicSecVulScoringMetricDefn</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A type of SecurityVulnerabilityMetricDefn that does not have any subordinate SecurityVulnerabilityMetricDefns, that is, an AtomicSecurityVulnerabilityMetricDefn is a leaf-level SecurityVulnerabilityMetric.  

Notes: Examples include Base Metrics - Access Vector, Authentication, and Access Complexity.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

