<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#CompositeBudget"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_forecastBudget -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_forecastBudget">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#CompositeBudget"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_unit -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_unit">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#CompositeBudget"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#FinancialAccount -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#FinancialAccount">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Finance ABE"/>
<rdf:label>FinancialAccount</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A FinancialAccount is part of the sub-ledger accounting that aggregates the amounts of one or more party accounts owned by a given party. Its an internal view of the CSP to manage incomes and outcomes. It is only an internal accounting which does not need to follow the GeneralLedger accounting regulation.

Each accounting event from a PartyAccount is logged to a FinancialAccount according to the assignment rules specified by PartyAccountAssignment.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_ID -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_ID">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#FinancialAccount"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_name -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_name">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#FinancialAccount"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_status -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_status">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#FinancialAccount"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_type -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_type">
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#FinancialAccount"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Business_Entity.Common Domain -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Business_Entity.Common Domain">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Common domain represents business roles, information and activities (e.g. business entities, business processes, functions, logical applications, interfaces, metrics, etc.) that support other Frameworx domains and are not specific to (i.e. are generic) or owned by any particular domain, or are referenced or utilized from two or more other domains.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Common Domain</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Anomaly ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Anomaly ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>Anomaly ABE represents any unusual or unexpected event, observation, pattern, or item that is significantly different from the norm that an enterprise wishes to detect, analyze, assess and mitigate within an autonomous environment.  In order for the autonomous operations environment to behave within the calibrated operational level, anomalies may require administrative and operational guidance.  Anomaly ABE entities provide a means of defining boundary conditions and lifecycle behavior for Anomalies, as well as providing control over the end-to-end management process for Anomalies.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Anomaly ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Anomaly ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasDomain_for_Anomaly ABE">
