<rdf:label>Anomaly</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>An abstract class that represents a particular type of Anomaly defined by the AnomalySpecification . Anomaly class is inherited to represent the specific domain requirement as well as the class of exceptional characteristic associated with a managed entity.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

