<rdf:label>ClosedLoopGoal</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Represents information that describes the target to be achieved by a closed loop along with all expected behavior and requirements to be fulfilled when the closed loop is ever instantiated. . Its an instance of Goal ABE with extensions particular for Closed Loops.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

