<rdfs:comment>Represents the strategy archetype of the closed loop. Closed loop models will generally fall under some or all of "Observe-Orient-Decide-Act" style and variants (MAPE-K, PADE, AADE, MADE, PDACE, MAI, etc.) of it.</rdfs:comment>
