<rdfs:comment>A set of common business entities that collectively serve as the foundation of the business view. This set of entities enables the entities in different domains of the SID Framework to be associated with each other, providing greater overall coherence to the information framework.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Root Business Entities ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

