<rdfs:comment>A type of ProjectDeliverable that is formed by aggregating other ProjectDeliverables, which may be composite or atomic ProjectDeliverables.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#AtomicVision -->

