<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Policy Event ABE"/>
<rdf:label>PolicyEventComposite</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This is a base class that represents the occurrence of a composite event. A composite event is an event that is made up of a set of PolicyEventAtomic and/or PolicyEventComposite entities. Like a PolicyEventAtomic, a PolicyEventComposite can also be used to trigger the evaluation of the condition clause of a PolicyRule.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

