<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Policy Value ABE"/>
<rdf:label>ValueStandard</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>ValueStandard is the abstract base class for defining a set of standardized PolicyValues. This set of PolicyValues will be added to over time, and represents a set of common values that are useful in a variety of PBNM applications. The subclasses of ValueStandard are a set of classes that define the semantics of commonly occurring variables that occur in PBNM applications.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

