<rdf:label>DNVariable</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This class is used to represent a single or set of Distinguished
Name variable, which may include wildcards. This variable type is specifically defined for retrieving LDAP-based data. Thus, only DNValue classes can be used in the value portion of the condition expression with this PolicyVariable.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

