<rdf:label>StringVariable</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This class is used to represent a single or set of string variable. Each can have wildcards. Thus, only StringValue classes can be used in the value portion of the condition expression with this PolicyVariable.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

