<rdf:label>PolicyActionPerformedDetails</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This class implements the semantics of the PolicyActionPerformedOn association. This association defines the set of PolicyActions that are performed on a ManagedEntity.
This association defines the set of PolicyActions that are performed on a ManagedEntity as a part of the policy management process. The semantics of this association are implemented by the PolicyActionPerformedDetails association class.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

