<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyPrivacyProfileType"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyPrivacyProfileTypeCharacteristic"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyPrivacyProfileTypeCharValue"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PrivacyCategory"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PrivacyUsagePurpose"/>
<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Party Privacy Profile Type ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Party Privacy Profile Type ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyPrivacyProfileType -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PartyPrivacyProfileType">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Party Privacy Profile Type ABE"/>
<rdf:label>PartyPrivacyProfileType</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A PartyPrivacyProfileType is a type of PartyProfileType.
A PartyPrivacyProfileType specifies for a Party playing a type of PartyRole (PartyRoleSpecification) such as Customer or User and possibly restricted to a context such as a set of ProductOfferings, all the available options that the Party may choose for each information concerned by the Privacy.
A PartyPrivacyProfileType may specify Privacy for several information using PartyPrivacyProfileTypeCharacteristic.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_category -->

