<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Party ABE"/>
<rdf:label>OrganizationName</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A word, term, or phrase by which an organization is known and distinguished from other organizations.A name is an informal way of identifying an object [Fowler]An OrganizationName is a type of PartyName.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

