<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PermissionScopeSpec -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PermissionScopeSpec">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Permission ABE"/>
<rdf:label>PermissionScopeSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>PermissionScopeSpec defines through PermissionScopeSpecPolicyRuleSpec criteria that might be used to define the scope such as market segment, geographic area, time
To describe these criteria that might be complex a PermissionScopeSpec might be managed by one or many PolicyRuleSpec (PermissionScopeSpecPolicyRuleSpec).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PermissionScopeSpecPolicyRuleSpec -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#PermissionScopeSpecPolicyRuleSpec">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Permission ABE"/>
<rdf:label>PermissionScopeSpecPolicyRuleSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>PermissionScopeSpecPolicyRuleSpec is used for describing PermissionScopeSpec criterias and the possible values.
To describe these criteria that might be complex a PermissionScopeSpec might be managed by one or many PermissionScopeSpecPolicyRuleSpec.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

