<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Currency ABE"/>
<rdf:label>Currency</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Represent the currency in reality. Currency uses 1 or more CurrencyUnits. For example, Currency (code=CNY, symbol= YEN) use three CurrencyUnits (Yuan, Jiao, Fen). Currency is associated to CurrencyExchangeRate with CurrencyUsedAsSource and CurrencyUsedAsDestination. Currency can be used in different Countrys.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

