<rdf:label>CurrencyName</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Name of a currency. Under different  languages, a currency has differnent names,  e.g. Renminbi Yuan in English and in Chinese to express the same Chinese currency.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

