<rdf:label>CurrencyUnit</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Measurement unit of a currency. For CurrencyUnitName Yuan associated to Chinese, rate =1, isStdUnit = True, isMinUnit = False.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

