<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MonitoredMetricObjectCriterion -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MonitoredMetricObjectCriterion">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Metric Monitoring ABE"/>
<rdf:label>MonitoredMetricObjectCriterion</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MonitoredMetricObjectCriterion defines the scope of monitored objects for which a MeasurementJob is executed.
The scope is either defined:
 by a filter on a Class (sub-class MonitoredMetricClassCriterion) 
 or by a list of instances (sub-class MonitoredMetricInstanceCriterion).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MonitoredMetricInstanceCriterion -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MonitoredMetricInstanceCriterion">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Metric Monitoring ABE"/>
<rdf:label>MonitoredMetricInstanceCriterion</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MonitoredMetricInstanceCriteripn is a type of MonitoredMetricObjectCriterion.
It defines the scope of monitored objects for which a MeasurementJob is executed by a list of instances through the relationship with one or several RootEntity instances.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MonitoredMetricClassCriterion -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#MonitoredMetricClassCriterion">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#BE"/>
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Metric Monitoring ABE"/>
<rdf:label>MonitoredMetricClassCriterion</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MonitoredMetricClassCriterion is a type of MonitoredMetricObjectCriterion.
It defines the scope of monitored objects for which a MeasurementJob is executed.by a filter on a class through the relationship with RootEntityType.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_objectInstanceFilter -->

<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_objectInstanceFilter">
