<rdf:label>GeographicLocationName</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A word, term, or phrase by which a Geographic Location is known and distinguished from other Geographic Locations. A name is an informal way of identifying an object [Fowler]Separating Location Name from Location allows for a Location to have many names at the same time and for names to change over time.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

