<rdf:label>CompAtomicConfigSpecRel</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A type of ConfgSpecRelationship that represents a group of ConfigurationSpecifications that are used to configure an ConfigurationSpecification that is made up of other ConfigurationSpecfications. For example, the ConfigurationSpecification for a connection may be composed of the specification for the connection as well as the specification for connection termination points that are assigned to the connection.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

