<rdfs:comment>A relationship between two Configurations.  One relationship may represent a group of Configurations that are configured. For example, the Configuration for a connection may be composed of the Configurations for the connection as well as for connection termination points that are assigned to the connection.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

