<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Communication Interaction ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Communication Interaction ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Communication Interaction ABE contains all entities needed for specifying a CommunicationInteraction describing an exchange of information during a communication between two or more human(s) and/or machine(s) during a period of time. 
CommunicationInteraction might concern Parties playing a role of Customer, Supplier or even Resource, therefore the ABE « Communication Interaction ABE » is located in « Shared Business Entities Domain ».</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Communication Interaction ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

