<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Business Interaction ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#Business Interaction ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Business Interaction ABE represents an arrangement, contract, or communication between an enterprise and one or more other entities such as individuals and organizations (or parts of organizations).  Interactions take on the form of requests, responses, and notifications.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Interaction ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

