<rdf:label>BusinessInteractionType</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The possible types of BusinessInteractions that can occur. BusinessInteractionTypes can be with the associated BusinessParticipantTypes that can participate in a BusinessInteraction.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

