<rdf:label>CommitmentProcurementRole</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A role a party plays in a relationship to a Commitment, such as a Buyer or Supplier, and in that role the party has procured the commitment of another party playing a role.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/InformationModel_v1#hasAttr_name -->

